Existing third-party copyright and license notices must be retained.
Dependencies such as PsychoPy, HDDM, R packages, MATLAB, and Stat4CI remain
subject to their respective terms; mentioning a dependency is not a grant
to redistribute it. TFED faces, morphs, average faces, noise faces, and
